# Architecture

Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `AGENTS.md` architecture sections.

## MUST

- Keep viewer-request behavior in the edge handler path
- Fail closed on `/admin` auth failures
- Preserve deep-link rewrite and canonical redirect unless intentionally changing with tests
- Keep scripts out of the Webpack edge bundle

## MUST NOT

- Add Next/React/UI frameworks to this package
- Fail open on JWT/cookie errors
- Bloat the edge zip toward Lambda@Edge size limits
